Horde NPC Rogue Revival
    Events
        Time - ReviveTimerRogue expires
    Conditions
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (NPC_Horde_AI_Rogue is in Companion_Group.) Equal to True
            Then - Actions
                -------- Set GY Player selected GY --------
                Set VariableSet GraveyardSelectNPC = GraveyardSelect
            Else - Actions
                -------- Set random GY if the hero is not in Companion Group --------
                Set VariableSet GraveyardSelectNPC = (Random integer number between 1 and 9)
